    {
      "title": "Daily Quests",
      "anchor": "Daily_Quests",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Daily Quests have been reviewed and corrected to give correct XP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Note: Now if you are unable to gain Wandering Market XP when you complete a Daily Quest you will instead get 150 Account XP."
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "New Daily Quests added to the pool:",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Get to Level 20 in (1 || 3) Matches."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Use Global Emotes (5 || 15) times."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Use Jump stamp (10 || 30) times."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Heal (10K || 30K) in the Fountain."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Use a non-default skin in ( 1 || 3) Matches."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Note: Weekly Quests will still not give Coins until you are below Coin Cap."
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Joust Visual Update",
      "anchor": "Joust_Visual_Update",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Joust has received a large-scale visual update, affecting lighting, textures, and more",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Full lighting revamp"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Newly shadowed Jungle areas"
                },
                {
                  "text": "More detailed material & texture updates"
                },
                {
                  "text": "A dynamic sky that changes based on your position in the map"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Subtle mood fog in Jungle spaces (disabled on Low settings)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Wet ground on Chaos side (disabled on Low settings)"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Ambient critters to bring the map to life (disabled on Low settings)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Ranked Reset",
      "anchor": "Ranked_Reset",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There will be a harder SR reset than normal, with increased variance (so people will move more)",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "We are looking at the top player, and squishing them down to 3000 SR. Everyone else gets proportionally 'squished' according to that."
                },
                {
                  "text": "So if the top person is 6600SR (this is pretty close to the actual amount); they go to 3000SR."
                },
                {
                  "text": "A person who is 3300SR would get squished to 1500SR."
                },
                {
                  "text": "And then on the back end we are raising variance."
                },
                {
                  "text": "We also might be adjusting gain/loss for this next split, as in how fast people can move up and down; but we are locking that in."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Quality Of Life",
      "anchor": "Quality_Of_Life",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "New Reporting Option: “Not Playing Assigned Role”",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "If a player ignores their role assignment in Conquest, use this option to report them."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Note: Playing off-meta God picks or trying a new build is not necessarily not playing the assigned role. However if a Solo laner is in Mid lane, if a Jungler is not Jungling, if a Support is behaving like a laner – those sorts of things qualify as “Not Playing Assigned Role.”"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Aspect Ability Descriptions Now Display in God Tab",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Selecting an Aspect in the God tab now updates Ability descriptions to reflect what the Aspect does"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Red Dot Notifications are Easier to Clear",
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "If you visit a tab with notifications, all notifications for that tab are cleared upon leaving the tab."
                },
                {
                  "text": "As an example, if you have a notification on a Jump Stamp, the Profile Loadout would have a red dot. If you click the Profile Loadouts, then back out of Profile Loadout, the red dot would be cleared."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Similarly, if an Anhur skin has a red dot, you can click on the Gods tab, then click on Anhur, then back out of Anhur and all red dots under Anur would be cleared."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "title": "Game Modes",
      "anchor": "Game_Modes",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "New: Multiqueue (Beta)",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Players can help us test an early version of Multiqueue in this update."
                },
                {
                  "text": "A new tile in Classic allows players to join the Multiqueue (Beta) queue, which will queue you for Conquest, Arena, and Joust simultaneously. You will be placed in the first available good match in those three queues."
                },
                {
                  "text": "Parties up to 3 may join this queue."
                },
                {
                  "text": "If you play One More Round, you will be requeued for Multiqueue (Beta), not for the mode you just played."
                },
                {
                  "text": "This may help players in low-population regions to find matches more quickly."
                },
                {
                  "text": "If the underlying tech performs well, this will be expanded in future updates to allow players to multiqueue for player-defined groups of modes."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "General",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Entering the fountain now cleanses regen effects from potions and chalices. (Using a potion while inside the fountain will still grant you Health/Mana regen. It will only be removed if you leave and re-enter.)"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Joust",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lane objectives now show the stun duration of the objective debuff"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The objective debuff now switches to the Phoenix if the debuff is still active when the Phoenix respawns."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Assault",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Artio is now considered a Tier 1 Healer in Random Draft"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Conquest",
              "bold": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Floating trees are now firmly attached to the ground"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
